        "paragraph_id": "part7_alberta_rules_of_court_rule_7_part_3_001",
        "section_heading": "Rule 7.4 – Alberta Rules of Court – Rule 7 (Part 3)",
        "text": "If summary judgment is given against one or more defendants or plaintiffs, the action may be continued by or with respect to any plaintiff or defendant not bound by the judgment.",
        "order": 2,
        "rule_number": "7.4",
        "heading": "Alberta Rules of Court – Rule 7 (Part 3)",
